{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Doomsday Dealer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy. Sell. Survive.</strong><br>Step into the shoes of a post-apocalyptic shopkeeper. Barter with desperate survivors, grow what you can, and turn your crumbling store into a lifeline for the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Deal with the Desperate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers line up at your counter with scavenged loot and desperate needs. Haggle over prices, make shady trades, or turn them away\u2014but every choice has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/f0a4d1f418998a96b0e9662e4f65dd7b.poster.avif?t=1771784261\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/f0a4d1f418998a96b0e9662e4f65dd7b.webm?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/f0a4d1f418998a96b0e9662e4f65dd7b.mp4?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Grow Your Own Supply</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, so get your hands dirty. Plant crops, water them, and tend to your tiny patch of survival. What you grow might just keep someone alive\u2026 or make you rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/c4e3e17c82c7574a0c305f0bd86e3afd.poster.avif?t=1771784261\" width=634 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/c4e3e17c82c7574a0c305f0bd86e3afd.webm?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/c4e3e17c82c7574a0c305f0bd86e3afd.mp4?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Explore the Wasteland\u2019s Vendors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out to other NPC shops in the ruins. Each trader has their quirks, inventory, and secrets. If you're clever, you might walk away with a rare item\u2014or a valuable connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/e851fcb9192513600151c8cdef112668.poster.avif?t=1771784261\" width=634 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/e851fcb9192513600151c8cdef112668.webm?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/e851fcb9192513600151c8cdef112668.mp4?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Customize Your Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your store with shelves, counters, lights, and signs. Whether you're running a humble shack or a fortified trading hub, make it yours\u2014style and function matter in the apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/609b396e5bcce6fe82ee0fa9fa5ee674.poster.avif?t=1771784261\" width=634 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/609b396e5bcce6fe82ee0fa9fa5ee674.webm?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/609b396e5bcce6fe82ee0fa9fa5ee674.mp4?t=1771784261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2497680?t=1771784261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2497680?t=1771784261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/d162afc990e439ec6c8fd79a77c79a13f30aa6b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771784261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/d162afc990e439ec6c8fd79a77c79a13f30aa6b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771784261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Doomsday Dealer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy. Sell. Survive.</strong><br>Step into the shoes of a post-apocalyptic shopkeeper. Barter with desperate survivors, grow what you can, and turn your crumbling store into a lifeline for the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Deal with the Desperate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers line up at your counter with scavenged loot and desperate needs. Haggle over prices, make shady trades, or turn them away\u2014but every choice has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/f0a4d1f418998a96b0e9662e4f65dd7b.poster.avif?t=1771784261\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497680/extras/f0a4d1f418998a96b0e9662e4f65dd7b